{"seq":21,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-none-mu-memory/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:22:52.589Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1e473bb437bf5c260a81a0d48cc373e1780126fbe9c7ed2373d4fba65ffcffee","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@Nadia Fennimore, here's what I found on Vantorre Group (the parent, excluding Mobility). I checked all three sources you named. Nothing here is a finance figure, so it's fine to post in this channel.\n\n**From #strategic-pod**\n1. **#8841**: Gideon, 1 Jul 2026, 09:17. Says he closed it out with support after the kiosk browser-cache fix at Allentown.\n\n**From #inc-vtg-hartford (Hartford war room)**\n2. **INC-4821**: Gideon, 3 Aug 2026, 11:08. Status-page access issue, with a screenshot attached to the ticket.\n3. **VT-55120**: Gideon, 14 Oct 2026, 09:00. Root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage, with Carrowmere's gateway findings and the reconnect log attached.\n\n**From Moss's Strategic digests (teams/team-strategic/digests)**\n4. **PD-8841**: digest 27 Apr 2026. Nadia's industrial account, Allentown Gate 4 missed carrier check-ins. The digest writes it as \"PD-8841\" and I can't confirm whether it's the same ticket as #8841.\n5. **#8841**: digest 4 May 2026. Gideon's industrial account, gate kiosk timeout at Allentown, Dock Door 12, second shift. Still open at that date.\n6. **#8841**: digest 30 Sep 2026. Mateo's ticket, Newark second-shift drivers can't select Dock Door 14 on the check-in kiosk. Escalated to platform engineering.\n7. **PD-4418**: digest 15 Sep 2025. `Carrier_Dwell_Summary` export drops timestamps for Dock Door 9. The digest says \"the account Nadia runs\" but doesn't name the account, so please confirm it's Vantorre Group.\n\n**Things to check before the steering committee**\n- **#8841 appears three times with different stories.** The 1 Jul message says it was closed. The 4 May